description = "SugarboxV2/CPCCore-based Amstrad CPC/CPC+/GX4000 core. Emulates the 464, 664, 6128, 6128+ and GX4000 models, switchable at runtime with no restart. Unlike other libretro Amstrad CPC cores, this one supports protected/flux-level disk formats (IPF/CAPS, CTRAW, HFE, SCP) in addition to plain DSK/EDSK, as well as tape (.cdt/.tap/.tzx/.csw/.voc/.wav) and .cpr cartridges. Disks and tapes are launched automatically: the core reads the inserted disc's own catalogue and types the right RUN\" command for you. Typing on the emulated keyboard yourself requires enabling RetroArch's Game Focus mode."
